格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A bridge that connects Openclaw and DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1341146422","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"ODSH-Bridge","slug":"Mikoribbit/ODSH-Bridge","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-desktop","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A bridge that connects Openclaw and DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# ODSH-Bridge for Docker — OpenClaw × DeepSeek Harness connectivity bridge (Docker edition)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** ·\n**中文**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **One-line positioning**: lets DeepSeek Harness (DSH, the execution layer) reach the OpenClaw (bra"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"in/persona layer)\n> gateway over WebSocket, hand off tasks reliably between the two containers throu"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"gh a shared directory bridge\n> (envelope + daemon), and — since **v1.1** — operate a **real Windows "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"desktop** on the host machine via\n> **SSH + Cua Driver** (SSH + Cua Driver execution path)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Navigation"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Quick Start · Configuration · Operations · Leases and migration"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 1. Architecture (text version)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"There are three data flows:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. **Realtime channel**: A DSH script connects to the OpenClaw gateway on 18789 as a \"paired device\""},{"id":"p10s2","text":"\n(HTTP Upgrade + origin allowlist + Ed25519 signature pairing + `connect.challenge` → `hello-ok`),\nt"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"hen calls methods in a JSON-RPC style.\n2. **Async bridge**: Either side writes a task envelope to `I"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"nput/T-*.json` → the daemon watches and\nexecutes it → atomically writes back `Output/<taskId>_result"},{"id":"p10s5","text":".json`, optionally notifying a Discord\nchannel via `oc-send`.\n3. **Windows desktop execution (v1.1+)"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"**: DSH calls `oc-cua.mjs` → `ssh` into the Windows host →\ninvokes `cua-driver call <tool> '<json>'`"},{"id":"p10s7","text":" → the driver operates the real desktop (snapshot,\nclick/type/hotkey, browser via CDP, app launch) *"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"*through the host desktop session**."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 2. Features"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Gateway access with explicit Origin and a persistent Ed25519 identity; permissions are controlled "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"by gateway approval.\n- Required shared local SQLite authority: atomic claims, renewal during asynchr"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"onous execution, conditional terminal commits and recoverable JSON result projections.\n- Echo, notif"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ication acknowledgement, trusted commands, bridge-confined file access and status; SSH + Cua Driver "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"for desktop operations.\n- Node >=22.13. Stop all old consumers before first initialization or upgrad"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"e and follow lease migration.\n- Shared browsers/desktops require one resource executor or external r"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"esource coordination; task leases govern task ownership and result commits."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 3. Deployment"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Requires: **Docker** + two images — OpenClaw (official `openclaw/openclaw:latest`) and DSH\n(no publi"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"c image; build `deepseek-harness:local` from the DeepSeek Harness repo)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Follow Quick Start to configure images, scaffold the bridge, initialize the authority and start cont"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ainers. Enable notifications explicitly with ODSH_NOTIFY=1."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Choose a guide for your task:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Page | Covers |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| **Quick Start** | getting the project, bring up containers, deploy the daemon, optional Cua |\n| **"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Configuration** | `.env` fields + directory structure |\n| **Integrations** | standalone daemon vs Co"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"rdis plugin |\n| **Operations** | Cua Windows desktop, security notes, troubleshooting |\n| **Roadmap*"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"* | phase-gated long-term plan (ClawHub, plugin ecosystem, event bus) |\n| **Protocol** | gateway han"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"dshake / JSON-RPC details |\n| **Leases** | local authority, migration and recovery |\n| **Bridge Spec"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"** | envelope format, state machine, zones |\n| **Maintenance** | maintenance and recovery |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Support"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"If this project helps you, consider supporting its maintainer:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> ☕ buymeacoffee.com/mikoribbit"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 4. Docs quick index (one-liner)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **New to ODSH Bridge?** → start with Quick Start.\n- **Anything about config/paths?** → Configurati"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"on.\n- **Cua Windows desktop, security, errors?** → Operations."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 5. Credits"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **odsh-interop (ClawHub)** — the OpenClaw-side skill is published on\nClawHub (package: `odsh-inter"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"op`); install with\n`openclaw skills install odsh-interop`.\n- **Cua** — this project's Windows deskto"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"p execution layer is powered by\nCua Driver (by the trycua team). Huge thanks for an open, cross-plat"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"form,\nfocus-safe computer-use driver that lets agents drive desktop apps without stealing the user's"},{"id":"p26s5","text":" cursor.\nThe Cua Driver is independently licensed by their authors — see their repository for detail"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ursor.\nThe Cua Driver is independently licensed by their authors — see their repository for details."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> Maintained by: ODSH Bridge contributors · License: MIT · Node >=22.13 · Zero-dependency ESM"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
